Have you seen him?
ເຈົ້າເຫັນລາວບໍ?

916
00:54:27,350 --> 00:54:29,350
[KAT]
Who?
ໃຜ?

917
00:54:29,850 --> 00:54:33,000
[MANDELLA]
William - he asked me to meet him here.
ວິລຍາມ - ລາວຂໍໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍພົບກັບລາວຢູ່ນີ້.

918
00:54:33,500 --> 00:54:37,350
[KAT]
Oh, honey -- tell me we haven't' progressed to full-on hallucinations.
